# OpenAI API Configuration for AI Image Validation
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Instructions to enable AI validation:
# 1. Sign up or log in to OpenAI Platform: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# 2. Create a new API key (starts with 'sk-')
# 3. Uncomment the line above and replace 'your_openai_api_key_here' with your actual API key
# 4. Save this file
# 5. Restart the application
#
# Example:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-1234567890abcdef...
#
# Benefits of AI validation:
# - Automatically detects and removes illustrations (like fish2, fish7)
# - Ensures only realistic photos are kept
# - Validates animals are in natural environments
# - Filters out compositions and collages
#
# Cost: Approximately $0.01-0.03 per image validated
# Keep this file secure and never commit it to version control